{"unit_id":"tag:03YC:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾一下，给定定义中的代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0001>（位于<MATH_0002>上），我们已经定义了小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）位点（sites）<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>，见《代数空间的性质》第<REF_0001>节。我们将不另说明地使用包含函子（inclusion functor）<MATH_0005>（《代数空间的性质》引理<REF_0002>）等同相应的拓扑斯（topoi），并称其为小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑斯（topos），对应于<MATH_0006>。接下来，建立这些位点（sites）所对应的拓扑斯（topoi）之间的一些关系。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"定义中给定的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"小平展位点和拓扑斯；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"已定义的位点；待批准。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"所比较的位点；待批准。"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子","context":"等同拓扑斯的函子；待批准。"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"各位点对应的拓扑斯；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"小平展拓扑斯；待批准。"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"所得的小拓扑斯；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
